    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know. i say that to myself too. but it's not just being tired. it's the sheer weight of it. seeing the same faces, the same pain, over and over... it makes everything feel so hollow. like there's no point in being the one who holds the spoon when the water just keeps coming. it's just so much. it feels like i'm just waiting for the moment i sink.",
