    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "an anchor just gets dragged down deeper the more weight you put on it. i guess i'm just wondering if there's actually any good in continuing the struggle, or if we're all just delaying the inevitable. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find some peace is to just stop trying to fight the current.",
